/**
 * Operational created-cohort metrics, not invoicing or provider reputation. Selects emails created in [from,to), scoped by email region and stream. Outcomes use current email state and all recorded events, including events after to; this is not a historical state snapshot. Each outcome counts distinct emails, so replays do not inflate counts and outcomes may overlap. Accepted (bucket sent) means evidence of provider acceptance, not merely queued/created. Daily UTC creation buckets contain count=created emails. Granularity defaults to day; granularity=hour additionally returns hourly UTC creation buckets with canonical ISO dates such as 2026-09-12T01:00:00.000Z, while preserving daily buckets and totals. Absent buckets mean zero created emails and zero outcomes; no moving averages are applied. Engagement is observed, not verified human activity.
 */
